      "text": "[9:15p.m.] #VI #VictoriaIsland #TrafficUpdate \n\nTraffic in and out of VI is now very good.\n\n- Ahmadu Bello Way;\n- Adeola Odeku;\n- Akin Adesola;\n- Ajose Adeogun;\n- Adetokunboh Ademola;\n- Aboyade Cole;\n- Ozumba Mbadiwe;\n- and Kofo Abayomi all in good shape.\n\nOur Men are strategically located to ensure traffic is seamless/\n@Sola_Giwa\n@gm_lastma\n@followlasg\n@GoldmyneTV\n@Mr_JAGs\n@gbenga_omo\n@TrafficChiefNG\n@channelstv\n@lagosMOT1\n@lagostraffic961\n@daily_trust\n@thecableng\n@walemusa\n@seunosiyemi_\n@vanguardngrnews\n@MobilePunch\n@NigeriaNewsdesk\n@TheNationNews\n@channelstv\n@FRSCNigeria\n@OlalekanOki\n@rrslagos767\n@Gidi_Traffic",
